              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amujiikili muŋinza yawuswana windi mwomuTiminati Sera, wekala mumpata yaEfweremi yamapidi, hamutamba wakabeta kakuchimunswa wampidi yaGayashi.",
          "type": "text",
