        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela amukalakeleli Yehova mafuku aYoshuwa ejima, nimafuku ejima adiŋuwu awakulumpi ashiyiliyi Yoshuwa, elukili mudimu waYehova wakogeleliyi aIsarela wejima.",
